          "settings": {
            "question": "Licensed Esthetician:",
            "answer": "<p>The Infraderm provides an essential foundation for clarifying and advanced facial regimens. Utilizing its custom-molded purple and pink electrodes, skincare specialists can seamlessly address congestion, promote post-extraction cellular recovery, and deliver targeted antibacterial benefits. The variable intensity control enables the practitioner to instantly modulate energy flow, ensuring that delicate skin types receive non-invasive, highly effective care without triggering undue erythema.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_74hYTC": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Aesthetic Clinic Director:",
            "answer": "<p>For facilities demanding maximum operational throughput and room versatility, this lightweight, compact device optimizes workstation logistics. The integrated electrode storage compartment mitigates the high operational cost of accidental tool breakage, keeping delicate components organized, secured, and ready for back-to-back treatment configurations. It serves as a high-margin service differentiator that elevates standard facial protocols.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_bhzmwM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Specialized Skincare Technician",
            "answer": "<p>When managing intensive or localized skin rebalancing protocols, practitioner mobility is paramount. The Infraderm features an industrial-grade, retractable twisted cord that effortlessly stretches to accommodate multi-angle practitioner movement without dragging across the client's field of treatment. This structural flexibility minimizes wrist fatigue during extended clinical applications while maximizing the delivery of the indirect massage modality.</p>"
          }
        }
